  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for libpng16",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libpng16 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-46675: Use-after-free of zlib input in `png_read_end` after incomplete zTXt, iTXt or iCCP decompression\n  (bsc#1283183).\n\nChanges for libpng16:\n\n- version update to 1.6.59 (jsc#PED-16190):\n * Fixed a regression introduced in version 1.6.47 that caused libpng to reject\n   hIST chunks in their correct position, after PLTE.\n * Prevented a double free of `png_struct` members after an allocation failure.\n * Applied fixes and updates to the CMake build.\n * Adopted the REUSE Specification for licensing the CI files.\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
